swap('The speaker used a {A} explanation that everyone understood, not an {B} account that concealed the facts. The new evidence could {C} the claim rather than {D} it as false.',['lucid','opaque','corroborate','refute'],['opaque','lucid','refute','corroborate'],'two-pair word swap');
